const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"先问指标量到了什么",en:"Start with what a metric measures"},body:{zh:"Schär用锁在合约中的资产说明DeFi的扩展，同时讨论其金融活动形式。锁仓量反映特定口径的资产存量，并不是交易次数、成交额或代币市值。编辑建议在比较规模时同时保留估值价格、资产范围和跨协议重复计算的处理。",en:"Schär introduces DeFi partly through assets locked in contracts. Total value locked is a stock under a chosen definition, not transaction count, trading volume or token market capitalization. Editorial application: retain valuation prices, asset scope and treatment of cross-protocol double counting."},reference:{url:"https://www.stlouisfed.org/-/media/project/frbstl/stlouisfed/publications/review/pdfs/2021/04/15/decentralized-finance-on-blockchain-and-smart-contract-based-financial-markets.pdf",label:{zh:"2021年Review期刊版 · §1",en:"2021 Review article · §1"}}},{title:{zh:"五层框架帮助定位依赖",en:"Five layers help locate dependencies"},body:{zh:"文章区分结算层、资产层、协议层、应用层和聚合层。读者看到的界面只是其中一层，背后可能组合多个协议与资产。分层的价值在于追问每一步依赖谁，而不是把一个易用界面直接等同于整个金融基础设施。",en:"The framework separates settlement, asset, protocol, application and aggregation layers. A visible interface is only one layer and may combine several protocols and assets. The framework helps trace dependencies instead of equating a convenient interface with the full financial infrastructure."},reference:{url:"https://www.stlouisfed.org/-/media/project/frbstl/stlouisfed/publications/review/pdfs/2021/04/15/decentralized-finance-on-blockchain-and-smart-contract-based-financial-markets.pdf",label:{zh:"2021年Review期刊版 · §2 · five-layer framework",en:"2021 Review article · §2 · five-layer framework"}}},{title:{zh:"上层透明不能修复底层缺陷",en:"Upper-layer transparency cannot repair lower-layer failure"},body:{zh:"各层建立在更低层的可用性与安全之上，因此一个应用即使交互清楚，也仍依赖结算与资产合约正确工作。编辑建议阅读产品说明时分开核对界面、协议规则和底层资产，而不是以一个可访问网页证明整条链路可靠。",en:"Higher layers depend on lower-layer availability and security. A clear interface still relies on settlement and asset contracts functioning correctly. Editorial application: assess the interface, protocol rules and underlying assets separately; a reachable website does not establish end-to-end reliability."},reference:{url:"https://www.stlouisfed.org/-/media/project/frbstl/stlouisfed/publications/review/pdfs/2021/04/15/decentralized-finance-on-blockchain-and-smart-contract-based-financial-markets.pdf",label:{zh:"2021年Review期刊版 · §2 · five-layer framework",en:"2021 Review article · §2 · five-layer framework"}}},{title:{zh:"代币表示与链下资产权利分开",en:"Token representation differs from off-chain entitlement"},body:{zh:"代币可以记录账本中的控制关系，也可以被用来表示外部资产。后一种情形仍需要理解发行者、保管与兑现安排，不能只看链上余额。编辑解读中，应把合约能够执行的规则与链下需要履行的承诺分别列出。",en:"A token can record ledger control or represent an external asset. The latter still requires understanding issuers, custody and redemption arrangements. Editorial interpretation: distinguish rules enforceable by the contract from obligations that must be fulfilled outside the chain."},reference:{url:"https://www.stlouisfed.org/-/media/project/frbstl/stlouisfed/publications/review/pdfs/2021/04/15/decentralized-finance-on-blockchain-and-smart-contract-based-financial-markets.pdf",label:{zh:"2021年Review期刊版 · §2.1",en:"2021 Review article · §2.1"}}},{title:{zh:"可组合性也意味着共享依赖",en:"Composability also creates shared dependencies"},body:{zh:"共同结算环境让不同协议能够组合出新的服务，减少重复建设。与此同时，组合服务会继承所用协议和外部数据的依赖。编辑建议画清资金与信息所经过的组件；多个不同品牌并不一定意味着底层风险已经分散。",en:"A shared settlement environment allows protocols to combine into new services. Combinations also inherit dependencies on constituent protocols and external information. Editorial application: trace the components carrying funds and information; several brands need not imply diversified underlying risk."},reference:{url:"https://www.stlouisfed.org/-/media/project/frbstl/stlouisfed/publications/review/pdfs/2021/04/15/decentralized-finance-on-blockchain-and-smart-contract-based-financial-markets.pdf",label:{zh:"2021年Review期刊版 · §3.1 · p. 169",en:"2021 Review article · §3.1 · p. 169"}}},{title:{zh:"确定执行不等于安全执行",en:"Deterministic execution is not safe execution"},body:{zh:"综述分别讨论代码错误、被破坏的前端、管理密钥和治理权集中等风险。确定性可以让同一规则重复执行，也可能让错误规则同样可靠地执行。审计、多签与时间锁可以缓解部分风险，但不应被读作绝对安全或当前部署已获验证。",en:"The survey distinguishes coding errors, compromised interfaces, admin keys and concentrated governance. Determinism can execute a flawed rule reliably too. Audits, multisignatures and timelocks mitigate some risks; they are not proof of absolute safety or verification of a current deployment."},reference:{url:"https://www.stlouisfed.org/-/media/project/frbstl/stlouisfed/publications/review/pdfs/2021/04/15/decentralized-finance-on-blockchain-and-smart-contract-based-financial-markets.pdf",label:{zh:"2021年Review期刊版 · §3.2 · p. 170",en:"2021 Review article · §3.2 · p. 170"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"这篇2021年综述提供分层阅读框架，不是当前协议安全评级。公开代码、确定性执行与审计都不能消除全部风险，代币记录也不能单独证明链下权利。",en:"This 2021 survey offers a layered reading framework, not a current protocol safety rating. Public code, deterministic execution and audits do not remove every risk; token records alone do not establish off-chain rights."}};export{e as default};
